# Put your signing identity's PUBLIC key / key-id here (committed, CODEOWNERS-guarded).
# The PRIVATE key stays in your gpg/ssh agent — NEVER in the repo. A human signs AS a
# human: a local agent must not be able to read and reuse this identity.
#
# Example (SSH-signing key id):
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA... martin@example.org
